KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
IELTS - Listening (Year 2023)

Q1. Which discourse marker signals an opposing viewpoint in academic speech?
  (A) On the contrary...
  (B) Furthermore...
  (C) Consequently...
  (D) For instance...
  Answer: A - 'On the contrary' directly introduces an antithesis or counterpoint.


